WEBVTT

00:02.669 --> 00:03.837
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.920 --> 00:05.046
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.130 --> 00:06.589
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.673 --> 00:08.466
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.550 --> 00:11.469
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.553 --> 00:13.638
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.722 --> 00:15.640
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.724 --> 00:17.475
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.559 --> 00:19.185
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.269 --> 00:21.563
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.646 --> 00:23.231
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.314 --> 00:25.567
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.650 --> 00:26.651
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.735 --> 00:27.819
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:27.902 --> 00:29.571
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.654 --> 00:31.656
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.740 --> 00:33.575
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.658 --> 00:37.203
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:55.722 --> 00:57.474
Squidward: ♪ La-la-da-da-da,
da-dum ♪
章鱼哥：♪ 啦-啦-哒-哒-哒，
达达姆♪

00:57.557 --> 00:59.726
♪ La-la-la, da-dum-dum ♪
♪ 啦啦啦，哒哒哒哒 ♪

00:59.809 --> 01:01.603
♪ La-la-la, da-da-da-dum ♪
♪ 啦啦啦，哒哒哒哒 ♪

01:01.686 --> 01:03.396
♪ Dum-dum-dum, dee-dee-dee ♪
♪ 达姆达姆，迪迪迪迪 ♪

01:03.480 --> 01:05.148
♪ La-la-la, da-da-da-dum ♪
♪ 啦啦啦，哒哒哒哒 ♪

01:05.231 --> 01:06.649
♪ Dum-de-dee, dum-de-dee ♪
♪ 杜姆-德-迪，杜姆-德-迪 ♪

01:06.733 --> 01:08.485
♪ La-la-da, da-da-da-doo ♪
♪ 啦啦哒，哒哒哒哒 ♪

01:08.568 --> 01:10.195
♪ Da-da-doo, dee-dee ♪
♪ 哒哒哒，迪迪 ♪

01:28.838 --> 01:33.635
Hello, and welcome one and all
to a super-special episode of
"House Fancy."
您好，欢迎大家
到一个超级特别的情节
“房子的幻想。”

01:33.718 --> 01:36.304
I'm your host, Nicholas Withers.
我是主持人尼古拉斯·威瑟斯。

01:36.387 --> 01:40.558
Our first very special guest
on today's show will be
none other than...
我们的第一位非常特别的客人
在今天的节目中将会
不是别人，正是……

01:46.022 --> 01:46.815
Hello?
你好？

01:46.898 --> 01:48.233
Uh, hello?
呃，你好？

01:48.316 --> 01:49.150
Ah...
啊...

01:49.234 --> 01:51.027
Hello.
你好。

01:51.110 --> 01:52.737
Man: Hello.
男：你好。

01:53.780 --> 01:56.032
This isn't Squilliam Fancy-son
这不是斯奎利姆花哨的儿子

01:56.115 --> 01:59.160
my lifelong rival who I met in
high school band class, is it?
我一生的对手
高中乐队课，是吗？

01:59.244 --> 02:00.912
The same.
相同。

02:00.995 --> 02:04.582
You wouldn't happen to be
watching "House Fancy",
would you?
你不会碰巧是
观看《奇幻之家》时，
你会吗？

02:04.666 --> 02:06.501
I was, until you called.
我是，直到你打来电话。

02:06.584 --> 02:12.465
Well, Squiddy,
I enjoy our chats,
but my catered lunch awaits.
嗯，鱿鱼，
我很享受我们的聊天
但我准备的午餐正在等待着。

02:12.549 --> 02:17.053
And you know how hard
being fabulous is
on an empty stomach  .
你知道有多难
令人难以置信的是
空腹时。

02:17.137 --> 02:19.806
Wait, why did you ask me if
I was watching "House Fancy"?
等等，你为什么问我是否
我在看《梦幻之家》？

02:19.889 --> 02:22.559
Sorry, Squilliam, but we've
gotta get back to the show.
抱歉，斯奎利姆，但我们已经
得回去表演了。

02:22.642 --> 02:25.436
Who's that talking
in the background?
是谁在说话
在后台？

02:25.520 --> 02:28.648
Oh, I'm dreadfully
sorry, Nicky dear.
哦，我太可怕了
对不起，亲爱的尼基。

02:28.731 --> 02:31.526
Well, toodle-ooh, Squidward.
嗯，哦，章鱼哥。

02:31.609 --> 02:33.403
Enjoy the program.
享受这个节目。

02:33.486 --> 02:36.531
Withers: OK, folks,
we'll be right back after
these important messages.
威瑟斯：好的，各位，
我们很快就会回来
这些重要信息。

02:40.243 --> 02:42.996
Welcome back to "House Fancy,"
I'm Nicholas Withers.
欢迎回到“梦幻之家”，
我是尼古拉斯·威瑟斯。

02:43.079 --> 02:45.957
Here next to me
is Squilliam Fancy-son.
在我旁边
是斯奎利亚姆·花式之子。

02:46.040 --> 02:47.333
Hello, peasants.
哈喽，农民们。

02:49.127 --> 02:53.464
Let me start by saying
what a lovely facade
you have, Mr. Fancy-son.
让我首先说
多么可爱的门面啊
你有，花式儿子先生。

02:53.548 --> 02:54.966
Why, thank you, Nick.
为什么，谢谢你，尼克。

02:55.049 --> 02:56.676
And your house doesn't look
too bad, either  .
而你的房子看起来并不
也太糟糕了。

02:56.759 --> 02:58.511
Oh, Nicky.
哦，尼基。

02:58.595 --> 03:03.057
Camera crew, can we get
a shot of Mr. Fancy-son's
fabulous house, please?
摄制组，我们可以得到
Fancy-son先生的一张照片
很棒的房子，好吗？

03:04.350 --> 03:08.229
Hey, that's no better
than my house.
嘿，这再好不过了
比我家的。

03:16.487 --> 03:19.991
I bid you welcome...
to my foyer.
我向你表示欢迎...
到我的门厅。

03:20.074 --> 03:21.534
It's simply glorious.
这简直就是光荣的。

03:21.618 --> 03:23.119
It's simply glorious.
这简直就是光荣的。

03:23.202 --> 03:24.913
It truly is, Nicky.
确实如此，尼基。

03:24.996 --> 03:28.374
It's like I've died
and gone to fancy heaven.
就好像我已经死了一样
然后去了幻想的天堂。

03:32.170 --> 03:34.130
Is that what I think it is?
是我想的那样吗？

03:34.213 --> 03:35.715
It sure is.
确实如此。

03:35.798 --> 03:37.967
It's a gilded doorknob.
这是一个镀金的门把手。

03:38.051 --> 03:40.219
Absolutely magical.
绝对神奇。

03:40.303 --> 03:42.513
Absolutely imported.
绝对进口。

03:42.597 --> 03:43.556
May I?
我可以？

03:43.640 --> 03:46.309
But of course.
当然。

03:46.392 --> 03:48.061
Oh... Lovely.
哦...可爱。

03:48.144 --> 03:49.646
Isn't it?
不是吗？

03:49.729 --> 03:52.440
Well, I have to say, Squilliam,
and I think I'm speaking for
好吧，我不得不说，斯奎利姆，
我想我是在代表

03:52.523 --> 03:54.859
all of our viewers out there
when I'm saying this.
我们所有的观众
当我说这句话的时候。

03:54.943 --> 03:56.361
You are truly a fancy man.
你真是一个花心的人。

03:56.444 --> 03:58.112
Oh, well.
那好吧。

03:58.196 --> 03:59.989
All this gushing
is perfectly deserved.
这一切都涌出
是完全应得的。

04:00.073 --> 04:02.492
And now, I would
like to present to you
而现在，我愿意
喜欢呈现给你

04:02.575 --> 04:06.537
my favorite room in the house.
房子里我最喜欢的房间。

04:08.498 --> 04:10.375
It's all custom.
这都是定制的。

04:10.458 --> 04:11.918
Look at this.
看看这个。

04:12.001 --> 04:15.672
It's my jewel-encrusted
toilet paper holder.
这是我的镶满宝石的
卫生纸架。

04:15.755 --> 04:18.341
Such class.
这样的班级。

04:20.009 --> 04:23.179
Come, let me
show you... the roof.
来吧，让我
给你看...屋顶。

04:23.262 --> 04:25.098
An elevator?
电梯？

04:25.181 --> 04:27.850
Watch your step.
注意你的脚步。

04:27.934 --> 04:32.480
This may take a while,
just sit back and relax.
这可能需要一段时间，
坐下来放松一下。

04:32.563 --> 04:34.649
What the?
什么？

04:34.732 --> 04:36.776
A whirlpool bath elevator?
漩涡浴缸电梯？

04:36.859 --> 04:39.153
I brought some soap.
我带了一些肥皂。

04:40.613 --> 04:41.948
All ashore.
全部上岸。

04:42.031 --> 04:45.410
Welcome to my rooftop garden.
欢迎来到我的屋顶花园。

04:45.493 --> 04:46.953
Romantic grotto...
浪漫的石窟...

04:47.036 --> 04:49.831
sparkling, berry,
mineral-soda waterfall...
闪闪发光，浆果，
矿泉水瀑布...

04:49.914 --> 04:52.625
and my personal favorite...
以及我个人最喜欢的...

04:52.709 --> 04:57.505
a 130-foot-long
sculpture of my unibrow.
130英尺长
我的一字眉雕塑。

04:57.588 --> 04:59.841
It's huge and lifelike.
它巨大而栩栩如生。

04:59.924 --> 05:05.847
If you look closely,
you'll notice it's made entirely
out of gilded doorknobs.
如果你仔细观察，
你会发现它是完全制成的
从镀金的门把手中。

05:05.930 --> 05:08.182
You have the fanciest...
你有最奇特的...

05:09.684 --> 05:10.643
Eh, what?
呃，什么？

05:10.727 --> 05:12.645
You have the fanciest...
你有最奇特的...

05:14.689 --> 05:16.774
I have the fanciest ring?
我有最漂亮的戒指吗？

05:16.858 --> 05:18.484
No, your phone is ringing.
不，你的电话响了。

05:18.568 --> 05:19.569
Oh.
哦。

05:21.112 --> 05:23.156
Hello?
你好？

05:23.239 --> 05:24.198
Oh, yeah, hang on.
哦，是的，坚持住。

05:24.282 --> 05:25.533
Uh, it's for you.
呃，这是给你的。

05:26.576 --> 05:27.910
Hello, hello?
喂，喂？

05:27.994 --> 05:28.995
Hello?
你好？

05:29.078 --> 05:30.079
Hello.
你好。

05:30.163 --> 05:31.998
My name is Squidward Tentacles.
我的名字是章鱼触手。

05:32.081 --> 05:36.002
And my house is  far  fancier
than that slob Squilliam's.
我的房子要漂亮得多
比那个邋遢的斯奎利姆的还要多。

05:36.085 --> 05:36.669
Really?
真的吗？

05:36.753 --> 05:38.254
Really.
真的。

05:38.337 --> 05:41.591
OK, we'll be at your house
in two hours with a camera crew.
好的，我们会去你家
与摄制组一起在两个小时内完成。

05:41.674 --> 05:43.718
Two hours?
两个小时？

05:43.801 --> 05:45.553
But I haven't even had time
to wash my hair.
但我还没来得及
洗头发。

05:45.636 --> 05:47.805
There's a stain
on the rug.
有一个污点
在地毯上。

05:47.889 --> 05:51.309
Uh, uh, ah, I'll use this chair
to hide it.
呃呃呃，我就用这把椅子
隐藏它。

05:51.392 --> 05:52.852
There we go.
我们开始吧。

05:52.935 --> 05:54.187
Now I'll just...  .
现在我就……

05:54.270 --> 05:56.355
There's a hideous hole
in that wall.
有一个可怕的洞
在那堵墙里。

05:56.439 --> 05:59.358
I'll just use this painting
to cover it up.
我就用这幅画
来掩盖它。

05:59.442 --> 06:00.651
Perfect.
完美的。

06:00.735 --> 06:02.361
No, no!
不，不！

06:03.863 --> 06:07.450
Oh, I'll never get this place
in shape in time.
噢，我永远也得不到这个地方
及时成形。

06:08.117 --> 06:09.786
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

06:09.869 --> 06:11.370
How long have you
been spying on me?
你有多久了
一直在监视我吗？

06:11.454 --> 06:12.872
Um... What day is it today?
嗯……今天是什么日子？

06:12.955 --> 06:15.583
It's the day you go away
and never come back.
这是你离开的那一天
永远不会回来。

06:15.666 --> 06:17.543
But Squidward, if I do that
但是章鱼哥，如果我这么做的话

06:17.627 --> 06:20.713
then how am I gonna
help you get your house ready
for the  big  T.V. show?
那我该怎么办
帮助你准备好你的房子
为了大型电视节目？

06:20.797 --> 06:21.714
How did you know about that?
你是怎么知道的？

06:21.798 --> 06:23.466
I was spying on you.
我在监视你。

06:23.549 --> 06:25.468
You want me to get
the cops down here again?
你想让我得到
警察又来了？

06:25.551 --> 06:28.221
Because...
因为...

06:28.304 --> 06:30.306
All right, fine.
好吧，好吧。

06:30.389 --> 06:33.434
One slip up, and you are
out of here,  comprendo?
一失足，你就
离开这里，明白吗？

06:33.518 --> 06:36.437
Mucho comprendo,
Señor Habanero.
非常理解，
哈瓦那先生。

06:36.521 --> 06:40.399
All right first I'm gonna
give you something  so  simple
好吧，我先去
给你一些如此简单的东西

06:40.483 --> 06:42.652
a person without a brain
could even get it done right.
一个没有大脑的人
甚至可以把事情做好。

06:42.735 --> 06:46.072
Hoo, that's good,
'cause I lent my brain
to Patrick for the weekend.
呵呵，这样就好了
因为我借出了我的大脑
去帕特里克度周末。

06:46.155 --> 06:46.823
Really?
真的吗？

06:46.906 --> 06:48.366
No, not really.
不，不是真的。

06:48.449 --> 06:50.827
He traded me these
two chocolate bars for it.
他用这些交换了我
两块巧克力。

06:50.910 --> 06:52.745
I don't care.
我不在乎。

06:52.829 --> 06:55.581
Just use this paint to cover up
that faded part
on the wall right there.
用这个油漆遮盖就可以了
那个褪色的部分
就在那儿的墙上。

06:55.665 --> 06:57.333
Don't touch anything else.
不要碰其他任何东西。

06:57.416 --> 06:59.210
OK.
好的。

07:10.012 --> 07:12.306
SpongeBob, what was that noise?
海绵宝宝，那是什么声音？

07:12.390 --> 07:15.768
Skin me alive
and drench me in boiling oil!
活剥我的皮
把我浸入滚烫的油里！

07:15.852 --> 07:17.395
What have you done
to my living room?
你做了什么
到我的客厅？

07:17.478 --> 07:19.939
I told you just to
paint the faded spot.
我告诉过你只是为了
涂上褪色的地方。

07:20.022 --> 07:22.024
Well, it all looked
kind of faded.
好吧，这一切看起来
有点褪色了。

07:25.194 --> 07:26.612
Never mind.
没关系。

07:26.696 --> 07:28.030
Maybe it won't
show up on camera.
也许不会
出现在相机上。

07:28.114 --> 07:29.365
Here, help me move this sofa.
来，帮我搬一下这张沙发。

07:29.448 --> 07:31.450
You got it, Squiddy,
where are we moving her to?
你明白了，鱿鱼，
我们要把她搬到哪里去？

07:31.534 --> 07:34.537
Hang on, I'm trying to get
a grip on the thing.
等一下，我正在努力争取
抓住事物。

07:34.620 --> 07:35.788
Now don't move it till I say...
现在别动它，直到我说……

07:35.872 --> 07:37.498
Ow!
噢！

07:37.582 --> 07:39.625
OK, it's on my foot, I don't...
好吧，它在我的脚上，我不...

07:39.709 --> 07:40.459
Ow!
噢！

07:40.543 --> 07:41.836
OK...
好的...

07:41.919 --> 07:42.837
Squidward: Ow!
章鱼哥：噢！

07:44.463 --> 07:47.133
SpongeBob, I told you
not to move it till I said...
海绵宝宝，我告诉过你了
不要动它，直到我说...

07:48.092 --> 07:49.135
Why do you keep moving it?
你为什么一直动它？

07:49.218 --> 07:50.553
'Cause you keep saying, "Ow!"
因为你总是说：“噢！”

07:52.555 --> 07:56.142
I don't need you,
I can move it myself.
我不需要你，
我自己可以搬。

07:57.894 --> 08:01.939
Wow, Squidward,
you're so strong.
哇，章鱼哥，
你太坚强了。

08:02.023 --> 08:04.984
And you split your sofa in half.
然后你把沙发分成两半。

08:05.067 --> 08:06.485
It'll be really easy
to move now.
这会很容易
现在就搬家。

08:07.612 --> 08:09.363
Oh, no, they're already here.
哦，不，他们已经来了。

08:09.447 --> 08:11.449
Go get a vacuum to clean up
all the sofa bits.
去拿吸尘器来清理一下
所有的沙发碎片。

08:11.532 --> 08:13.618
I gotta run upstairs
and dress my wound.
我得跑上楼
并包扎我的伤口。

08:13.701 --> 08:14.952
Roger.
罗杰.

08:15.036 --> 08:17.830
OK, Squidward, found the vacuum.
好的，章鱼哥，找到了真空。

08:17.914 --> 08:20.124
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

08:20.208 --> 08:23.461
Well, I'll just vacuum for him.
好吧，我就帮他吸尘吧。

08:27.924 --> 08:30.468
Hmm, Squidward's house
is really messy.
嗯，章鱼哥的家
真的很乱。

08:30.551 --> 08:32.511
I'm gonna need some extra power.
我需要一些额外的力量。

08:52.782 --> 08:55.201
OK, SpongeBob, I finished-
What the?
好吧，海绵宝宝，我完成了——
什么？

08:56.494 --> 09:00.039
Don't worry, Squidward,
I'll turn it off.
别担心，章鱼哥
我会把它关掉。

09:00.122 --> 09:01.374
Come out of there.
从那里出来。

09:02.291 --> 09:04.001
Uh, hang on, please.
呃，请坚持住。

09:05.336 --> 09:07.588
Please, just one more
minute, Nick.
请再多一张
分钟，尼克。

09:07.672 --> 09:08.965
Who's Nick?
尼克是谁？

09:09.048 --> 09:10.883
Sorry, Squidward,
I couldn't wait any longer.
对不起，章鱼哥，
我不能再等了。

09:10.967 --> 09:13.886
I gotta use your toilet,
no questions, thanks.
我得用你的厕所
没有问题，谢谢。

09:20.101 --> 09:21.936
Whoo.
呼。

09:22.019 --> 09:25.273
I wouldn't go in there
for a couple days.
我不会进去的
几天了。

09:25.356 --> 09:26.107
Or weeks.
或者几周。

09:28.818 --> 09:30.236
Please, please...
拜托，拜托...

09:30.319 --> 09:31.779
Somebody put me
out of my misery.
有人把我
出于我的痛苦。

09:35.032 --> 09:37.868
Have mercy on my soul...
怜悯我的灵魂...

09:40.997 --> 09:42.415
Oh, hey, Squidward.
哦，嘿，章鱼哥。

09:42.498 --> 09:45.251
If you see SpongeBob,
can you give him his brain back?
如果你看到海绵宝宝
你能把大脑还给他吗？

09:45.334 --> 09:47.837
I was borrowing it
for the weekend.
我是借的
周末。

09:47.920 --> 09:50.464
I'll just set it, uh, here.
我就设置一下，呃，这里。

09:50.548 --> 09:51.924
See you.
再见。

09:57.888 --> 09:59.098
Thank you, Patrick.
谢谢你，帕特里克。

10:00.975 --> 10:02.977
Oh, no.
哦，不。

10:14.030 --> 10:16.282
Hello, and welcome back
to "House Fancy."
你好，欢迎回来
到“幻想之家”。

10:16.365 --> 10:19.285
We're arriving at the home of
a Mr. Squidward Tentacles
我们即将抵达
章鱼哥先生的触手

10:19.368 --> 10:23.956
who claims his house
is far fancier than that of
Squilliam Fancy-son.
谁声称拥有他的房子
远比
斯奎利亚姆，花哨的儿子。

10:24.040 --> 10:25.541
Let's take a look.
我们来看一下。

10:30.546 --> 10:33.924
Well, I, uh, um, I-I-I, I'm not
quite sure how to say this.
嗯，我，呃，嗯，我-我-我，我不是
很确定该怎么说。

10:34.008 --> 10:35.968
Go ahead, say it.
来吧，说吧。

10:36.052 --> 10:39.930
Withers: Squidward Tentacles,
you seem to have ushered in
凋灵：章鱼触手，
你似乎迎来了

10:40.014 --> 10:43.559
an entire new era
in house fanciness.
一个全新的时代
在室内幻想中。

10:43.642 --> 10:44.435
Huh?
啊？

10:44.518 --> 10:45.978
I have... I have?
我有……我有？

10:46.062 --> 10:48.939
What you have done here harkens
back to the illustrious
你在这里所做的事令人耳目一新
回到辉煌

10:49.023 --> 10:51.484
post-primitive movement
popularized by famous designer
Sol Limpkins.
后原始运动
被著名设计师所推崇
索尔·林普金斯。

10:51.567 --> 10:53.778
Say, was he a big
inspiration for you?
说吧，他是个大人物吗？
对你有启发吗？

10:53.861 --> 10:55.821
Why, yes.
为什么，是的。

10:55.905 --> 10:57.323
I've studied him for... years.
我研究他已经……很多年了。

10:58.741 --> 11:01.619
I would like to announce
that Squidward's house
我想宣布
那个章鱼哥的房子

11:01.702 --> 11:04.622
will be featured in
an hour-long, commercial-free
"House Fancy" special.
将出现在
时长一小时，无广告
特别版“House Fancy”。

11:04.705 --> 11:09.585
And... Squidward will be crowned
"House Fancy" Prince of the Year
而且......章鱼哥将加冕
“House Fancy”年度王子

11:09.668 --> 11:12.797
an honor which was originally
to be bestowed upon Squilliam
原本是一种荣誉
被授予斯奎利姆

11:12.880 --> 11:13.839
but,  , now isn't.
但是，现在不是。

11:18.427 --> 11:20.888
Oh, don't worry, Squilliam.
哦，别担心，斯奎利姆。

11:20.971 --> 11:23.724
I might be able to get Squidward
to help you redecorate.
我也许能得到章鱼哥
来帮助您重新装修。

11:23.808 --> 11:25.017
He is a personal friend of mine.
他是我的私人朋友。

11:25.101 --> 11:26.644
You know success
hasn't gone to his head?
你知道成功
还没到他的头上吗？

11:26.727 --> 11:29.230
He is still the same, old,
great guy, he has not changed.
他还是老样子，
伟大的家伙，他没有改变。

11:43.953 --> 11:46.288
And this is
the maximum-security level.
这是
最高安全级别。

11:46.372 --> 11:49.667
Since this is your first day,
I'll let you peek at
our number-one inmate.
由于这是您的第一天，
我让你看看
我们的头号囚犯。

11:49.750 --> 11:52.378
He's too dangerous
to let him around
the other inmates.
他太危险了
让他四处走动
其他囚犯。

11:52.461 --> 11:54.880
Why, what'd he do, rob a bank?
为什么，他做了什么，抢劫银行？

11:54.964 --> 11:59.593
Worse, he tried to steal
the Krabby Patty formula.
更糟糕的是，他还试图偷窃
蟹黄饼配方。

11:59.677 --> 12:01.971
Oh, OK...
哦，好吧……

12:02.054 --> 12:06.600
So that's why we keep him
behind these impenetrable,
six-inch steel doors.
所以这就是我们留住他的原因
在这些难以捉摸的背后，
六英寸钢门。

12:07.643 --> 12:09.228
'Course, it helps to lock it.
当然，锁定它会有所帮助。

12:09.311 --> 12:10.479
He's gone.
他走了。

12:10.563 --> 12:12.731
He's so small,
he could be anywhere.
他那么小，
他可以在任何地方。

12:12.815 --> 12:14.608
He could be right
under our noses.
他可能是对的
在我们眼皮底下。

12:17.486 --> 12:20.364
Uh, Frank, where's
your moustache?
呃，弗兰克，在哪里
你的小胡子？

12:31.500 --> 12:33.961
Those fools'll
never find me now.
那些傻瓜会
现在再也找不到我了。

12:34.837 --> 12:39.175
Aw, come on, baby, you know
how long I've been in the stir.
噢，来吧，宝贝，你知道的
我已经有多久了。

12:39.258 --> 12:40.718
Woman: Get out.
女：出去吧。

12:40.801 --> 12:43.137
And stay out,
you two-time loser.
并留在外面，
你这个两次失败者。

12:43.220 --> 12:45.014
After everything
I've done for you.
一切之后
我已经为你做了。

12:45.097 --> 12:49.310
Woman: Beat it, you jail-bird,
and take all your junk too.
女人：打住吧，你这个囚徒，
并带走所有的垃圾。

12:54.064 --> 12:56.442
Well, that's just great.
嗯，那太好了。

12:56.525 --> 12:58.861
Hey, it's my old guitar.
嘿，这是我的旧吉他。

12:58.944 --> 13:02.239
I used to play it when I was
in that band as a kid.
我小时候也玩过
小时候在那个乐队里。

13:02.323 --> 13:05.326
Man, those were good times.
伙计，那是美好时光。

13:05.409 --> 13:07.203
OK, everybody.
好的，大家。

13:07.286 --> 13:09.413
One, two, a-one-two-three.
一、二、一一二三。

13:14.460 --> 13:17.463
You know, I don't think
I've had any good times.
你知道，我不认为
我曾经有过美好的时光。

13:17.546 --> 13:20.925
SpongeBob: ♪ Oh, I wish I was
frying up some Krabby Patties ♪
海绵宝宝：♪哦，我希望我是
煎一些蟹肉饼 ♪

13:21.008 --> 13:23.511
♪ That's what I really
love to do ♪
♪ 这就是我真正的想法
喜欢做♪

13:23.594 --> 13:25.471
♪ Take a cup full of
boo-ooh-ooh ♪
♪ 拿一杯满满的
呜呜呜 ♪

13:25.554 --> 13:27.890
♪ And a pinch of awoogah ♪
♪ 还有一点 awoogah ♪

13:27.973 --> 13:29.642
♪ A teaspoon of
♪
♪ 一茶匙
♪

13:29.725 --> 13:32.770
He's singing about
the Krabby Patty.
他唱的是关于
蟹肉饼。

13:32.853 --> 13:35.314
If I could just get him
to explain that song
如果我能得到他就好了
解释那首歌

13:35.397 --> 13:37.149
I'll have
the Krabby Patty formula.
我会有
蟹黄饼配方。

13:37.233 --> 13:38.651
♪ Mix in some... ♪
♪ 混合一些... ♪

13:38.734 --> 13:40.444
Hi, SpongeBob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

13:40.528 --> 13:42.363
That's a real nice song.
这真是一首好听的歌。

13:42.446 --> 13:44.573
♪ Add a splash of whee... ♪
♪ 添加一点点…♪

13:44.657 --> 13:47.493
But could you explain
those "whee" parts?
但你能解释一下吗
那些“哇”的部分？

13:47.576 --> 13:49.537
♪ And when I'm done,
I chop up some ♪
♪ 当我完成后，
我切了一些♪

13:50.704 --> 13:52.873
♪ Oh, oh-oh, oh-oh... ♪
♪ 哦，哦，哦，哦，哦...♪

13:52.957 --> 13:54.416
Are you out of your mind?
你疯了吗？

13:54.500 --> 13:58.254
Uh, I mean, that was
a delightful song
you were singing.
呃，我是说，那是
一首令人愉快的歌曲
你在唱歌。

13:58.337 --> 14:00.256
Thanks, Plankton.
谢谢，浮游生物。

14:00.339 --> 14:02.841
Mr. Krabs makes me censor out
all the patty ingredients
from my lyrics.
蟹老板让我审查
所有肉饼配料
从我的歌词中。

14:02.925 --> 14:04.677
Oh, that's terrible.
哦，那太可怕了。

14:04.760 --> 14:06.929
Krabs shouldn't stifle
a true artist like you.
螃蟹不应该窒息
像你这样真正的艺术家。

14:07.012 --> 14:10.266
Go ahead and sing
your patty song uncensored.
继续唱歌吧
你的帕蒂歌曲未经审查。

14:10.349 --> 14:12.977
I know
what you're doing.
我知道
你在做什么。

14:13.060 --> 14:15.646
What, me, I'm not trying
to steal the patty formula.
什么，我，我不努力
窃取肉饼配方。

14:15.729 --> 14:19.275
You want me to...
join your band.
你要我...
加入你的乐队。

14:19.358 --> 14:21.026
What band, I don't have a band.
什么乐队，我没有乐队。

14:21.110 --> 14:23.028
Oh, but you can't fool me.
噢，但你骗不了我。

14:23.112 --> 14:25.155
Not when you got an awesome
guitar like that.
不是当你有一个很棒的
吉他之类的。

14:25.239 --> 14:29.034
And only a true rocker
would have hair as greasy
and nasty as yours.
只有真正的摇滚乐手
头发会很油腻
和你一样令人讨厌。

14:29.118 --> 14:31.745
It'll be so cool, we could
write songs together.
太酷了，我们可以
一起写歌。

14:31.829 --> 14:33.038
Songs?
歌曲？

14:33.122 --> 14:34.373
Yes.
是的。

14:34.456 --> 14:36.959
And you can teach me
your Krabby Patty songs.
你可以教我
你的克拉比帕蒂歌曲。

14:37.042 --> 14:38.210
Yay.
耶。

14:38.294 --> 14:39.962
Come on, let's go
get our band together.
来吧，我们走吧
让我们的乐队聚在一起。

14:40.045 --> 14:41.547
Patrick, Patrick.
帕特里克，帕特里克。

14:41.630 --> 14:42.548
SpongeBob, SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝。

14:42.631 --> 14:44.216
Patrick, I've got big news.
帕特里克，我有一个大消息。

14:44.300 --> 14:45.843
Me too, me too.
我也是，我也是。

14:45.926 --> 14:47.177
What's your news?
你有什么消息吗？

14:47.261 --> 14:49.221
I found out where
boogers  come from.
我发现在哪里
鼻屎来自。

14:51.348 --> 14:52.391
Ew, really?
呃，真的吗？

14:52.474 --> 14:53.934
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

14:54.018 --> 14:55.394
What's your news?
你有什么消息吗？

14:55.477 --> 14:58.188
Plankton just asked me
to join his rock-n-roll band.
浮游生物刚刚问我
加入他的摇滚乐队。

14:58.272 --> 14:59.898
Can Patrick join our band?
帕特里克可以加入我们的乐队吗？

14:59.982 --> 15:01.108
Sure, whatever.
当然，无论如何。

15:01.191 --> 15:02.151
Hear that, Patrick, you're in.
听着，帕特里克，你进来了。

15:02.234 --> 15:03.485
All right.
好的。

15:03.569 --> 15:05.988
I play a mean belly.
我玩的是卑鄙的肚子。

15:16.665 --> 15:19.460
Wow, Patrick,
we're gonna be famous!
哇，帕特里克，
我们会出名的！

15:21.545 --> 15:23.255
Give me a break.
让我休息一下。

15:23.339 --> 15:25.341
You don't know
anything about music.
你不知道
关于音乐的任何事情。

15:25.424 --> 15:27.843
Too bad you're not
a musical genius.
可惜你不是
音乐天才。

15:27.926 --> 15:29.428
Like me.
像我这样的。

15:29.511 --> 15:31.138
SpongeBob: Oh, Squidward...
海绵宝宝：噢，章鱼哥……

15:32.723 --> 15:33.849
What the...
什么...

15:33.932 --> 15:36.518
Well, I  could  help you.
嗯，我可以帮助你。

15:36.602 --> 15:40.064
But I wouldn't soil my art
playing rock-n-roll.
但我不会玷污我的艺术
玩摇滚乐。

15:40.147 --> 15:43.484
Dressing all in black,
wearing boots covered in spikes
一身黑衣打扮，
穿着布满尖刺的靴子

15:43.567 --> 15:49.448
playing enormous stadiums
filled with screaming,
adoring fans...
在巨大的体育场进行比赛
充满了尖叫声，
崇拜的粉丝...

15:49.531 --> 15:52.826
clapping, demanding encores...
鼓掌，要求加演……

15:52.910 --> 15:54.578
cheering me...
为我加油...

15:56.121 --> 15:58.123
Oh, uh, changed my mind.
哦，呃，我改变主意了。

15:58.207 --> 16:00.793
I'll join your band
and help you bottom-feeders.
我会加入你的乐队
并帮助你底层饲养者。

16:00.876 --> 16:02.795
But I gotta get in shape first.
但我得先把身材练好。

16:02.878 --> 16:05.798
Isn't this great, Plankton,
Squidward is gonna help us.
这不是很棒吗，浮游生物，
章鱼哥会帮助我们的。

16:05.881 --> 16:06.924
Hmm?
唔？

16:07.007 --> 16:09.551
Uh, yeah, great.
呃，是的，太棒了。

16:10.719 --> 16:12.554
You know, Patrick,
being in a band
你知道，帕特里克，
在乐队中

16:12.638 --> 16:17.851
gives you the liberty
to dress with a little more...
Uh, how should I put this?
给你自由
to dress with a little more...
Uh, how should I put this?

16:17.935 --> 16:18.811
Yeah?
是的？

16:18.894 --> 16:21.230
Well, with just a little more...
好吧，还有一点……

16:21.313 --> 16:23.065
Go ahead, say it, SpongeBob.
说吧，海绵宝宝。

16:23.148 --> 16:24.858
You know, pizzazz.
你知道，活力四射。

16:24.942 --> 16:27.319
Perhaps
you didn't notice...
也许
你没有注意到...

16:27.403 --> 16:28.737
my new hairdo.
我的新发型。

16:28.821 --> 16:31.615
SpongeBob: Whoa-ho-ho,
I stand corrected.
海绵宝宝：哇喔喔，
我纠正了。

16:31.699 --> 16:34.284
And unlike your
nasty, little wig...
与你不同的是
讨厌的小假发……

16:34.368 --> 16:35.494
Mine is real.
我的是真的。

16:35.577 --> 16:37.579
Man, how'd you
grow that so fast?
伙计，你怎么样
长得这么快？

16:37.663 --> 16:40.582
Natural talent, watch this...
天赋异禀，看这个……

16:43.293 --> 16:44.837
Whoo, yeah!
呼，是啊！

16:44.920 --> 16:46.255
Dig that fancy follicle work.
挖掘那个奇特的毛囊工作。

16:46.338 --> 16:50.175
Hey, check this one out.
嘿，看看这个。

16:53.095 --> 16:55.973
Oh, man, Squidward's
not gonna want to miss this.
哦，伙计，章鱼哥的
不想错过这个。

16:57.057 --> 16:58.267
Squidward: Hello?
章鱼哥：喂？

16:58.350 --> 16:59.518
Hi, Squidward, aren't you
coming to band practice?
嗨，章鱼哥，是吗？
来参加乐队排练吗？

16:59.601 --> 17:00.936
Are you kidding?
你在开玩笑吧？

17:01.019 --> 17:03.439
I've got a lot of work to do
before I'm famous.
我有很多工作要做
在我出名之前。

17:07.067 --> 17:10.195
OK, then,
we'll keep your seat warm.
好吧，那么，
我们会为您的座位保暖。

17:10.279 --> 17:11.113
Patrick?
帕特里克？

17:11.196 --> 17:13.782
I'm on it.
我正在做。

17:13.866 --> 17:15.659
Greetings, fellow band-mates.
问候，乐队伙伴们。

17:15.743 --> 17:17.369
Hey, Plankton, what's that?
嘿，浮游生物，那是什么？

17:17.453 --> 17:18.370
T-shirts.
T 恤。

17:18.454 --> 17:19.371
Ooh.
哦。

17:19.455 --> 17:21.540
Oh, boy, oh, boy, oh, boy...
哦，男孩，哦，男孩，哦，男孩……

17:22.624 --> 17:25.043
Ah, "Plankton and the...
啊，“浮游生物和……

17:25.127 --> 17:26.336
Patty Stealers"?
偷帕蒂的人”？

17:26.420 --> 17:28.547
Uh, if you guys
don't like the name, uh...
呃，如果你们
不喜欢这个名字，呃...

17:28.630 --> 17:31.425
I...
我...

17:31.508 --> 17:32.801
Love it!
爱它！

17:32.885 --> 17:34.386
Kind of vague and mysterious.
有点模糊又神秘。

17:34.470 --> 17:35.888
Can I get mine in pink?
我可以买粉色的吗？

17:39.433 --> 17:40.726
It looks like a tattoo.
它看起来像一个纹身。

17:40.809 --> 17:43.270
Hey, Plankton, can our
first song go like this?
嘿，浮游生物，我们可以吗？
第一首歌是这样的吗？

17:45.397 --> 17:47.566
And then turn into one of
those songs that goes...
然后变成其中之一
那些歌曲...

17:51.236 --> 17:54.573
Yes, perfect, now all we need
are the lyrics.
是的，完美，现在我们需要的一切
是歌词。

17:54.656 --> 17:56.575
You know, something personal.
你知道，一些个人的事情。

17:56.658 --> 18:01.205
Maybe a secret you know,
or a favorite recipe, hmm?
或许有你知道的秘密
或者最喜欢的食谱，嗯？

18:01.288 --> 18:04.708
Or... One about
my new friend Plankton?
或者...一个关于
我的新朋友浮游生物？

18:04.792 --> 18:06.085
Or the adventures of...
或者说是冒险……

18:06.168 --> 18:08.378
Stop it,  .
别说了，。

18:08.462 --> 18:13.133
The best kind of lyrics
are the ones that are
deep and revealing.
最好的歌词
是那些
深刻而富有启发性。

18:13.217 --> 18:15.552
Something only you know?
有什么只有你知道的事？

18:15.636 --> 18:16.929
Secret recipe.
秘方。

18:17.012 --> 18:19.598
I once searched for
my innermost secrets.
我曾经寻找过
我内心深处的秘密。

18:19.681 --> 18:22.726
All I found was this.
我发现的只有这个。

18:22.810 --> 18:25.145
Is that what
you mean, Plankton?
是这样吗
你是说，浮游生物？

18:31.235 --> 18:32.277
SpongeBob: What is that?
海绵宝宝：那是什么？

18:32.361 --> 18:35.697
It's my, uh,
recording equipment.
这是我的，呃，
录音设备。

18:37.407 --> 18:40.744
Oh, my gosh, what do I do?
哦，天哪，我该怎么办？

18:40.828 --> 18:44.206
Just take a seat here,
and I'll strap you in.
就在这里坐吧，
我会把你绑起来。

18:45.916 --> 18:49.294
Now just relax and let
the equipment do its job.
现在放松并让
设备发挥其作用。

18:55.425 --> 18:59.638
Now let's see what's
locked in his subconscious.
现在让我们看看是什么
锁在他的潜意识里。

19:01.682 --> 19:06.478
♪ Time to feed him,
time to feed him,
now it's Gary's feeding time ♪
♪ 是时候喂他了，
有时间喂他，
现在是加里的喂食时间♪

19:06.562 --> 19:07.688
Nope.
没有。

19:09.398 --> 19:12.025
♪ Brush, brush, brush my teeth,
gently keep them clean ♪
♪ 刷牙，刷牙，刷牙，
轻轻地保持它们清洁♪

19:12.109 --> 19:16.446
The Krabby Patty formula's
gotta be in here somewhere.
蟹黄饼配方的
一定在这儿的某个地方。

19:18.574 --> 19:21.410
What's going-  ...
这是怎么回事——...

19:29.209 --> 19:30.377
I'm a failure.
我是个失败者。

19:30.460 --> 19:32.170
Cheer up, Plankton.
振作起来，浮游生物。

19:32.254 --> 19:35.465
We've still got a whole week
before our first gig
at the Krusty Krab.
我们还有整整一周的时间
在我们的第一次演出之前
在蟹堡王。

19:37.676 --> 19:39.386
At the Krusty Krab?
在蟹堡王？

19:39.469 --> 19:42.472
Uh-huh, but old man Krabs
doesn't want us bugging
the customers.
嗯嗯，但是螃蟹老头
不想让我们打扰
客户。

19:42.556 --> 19:44.683
So we have to go in after hours
when nobody's there.
所以我们必须在下班后进去
当没人在的时候。

19:44.766 --> 19:47.519
When nobody's there?
当没人的时候？

19:58.614 --> 20:02.075
My perfect dream-body.
我完美的梦想身体。

20:07.915 --> 20:10.584
Narrator: One week later...
旁白：一周后……

20:12.920 --> 20:16.173
Oh, no, it's the cops,
I can't let them see me.
哦，不，是警察，
我不能让他们看到我。

20:16.256 --> 20:17.341
Why?
为什么？

20:17.424 --> 20:18.383
Why?
为什么？

20:18.467 --> 20:20.719
Uh, cops are autograph hounds.
呃，警察是签名猎犬。

20:20.802 --> 20:22.221
Yeah, they're always after me.
是的，他们总是在追赶我。

20:22.304 --> 20:23.430
Mm, that's tough.
嗯，这很难。

20:23.513 --> 20:25.891
Don't worry, I'll hide you.
别担心，我会隐藏你的。

20:25.974 --> 20:28.685
Hey, what are you kids
up to this late at night?
嘿，你们是什么孩子？
深夜都熬到这一步了？

20:28.769 --> 20:30.312
We're on our way
to our first gig.
我们正在路上
到我们的第一场演出。

20:30.395 --> 20:31.855
We're in a band.
我们在一个乐队里。

20:31.939 --> 20:35.359
A band, huh, well, that's, uh...
乐队，呃，呃，那个……

20:35.442 --> 20:36.944
Oh.
哦。

20:37.027 --> 20:37.986
Uh, you've got a, uh...
呃，你有一个，呃...

20:38.070 --> 20:40.155
Got a, uh, what  ?
有一个，呃，什么？

20:40.238 --> 20:42.741
Uh... it's right...
呃……没错……

20:42.824 --> 20:47.496
Yes  ?
是的  ？

20:47.579 --> 20:50.707
Just keep your nose clean, kid.
保持你的鼻子干净，孩子。

20:50.791 --> 20:52.793
Sure thing, officer.
当然可以，军官。

20:54.878 --> 20:56.838
They're gone.
他们走了。

20:56.922 --> 21:01.551
You will never
speak of this to anyone.
你永远不会
与任何人谈论这件事。

21:01.635 --> 21:03.136
Come on, come on, hurry up.
来吧，来吧，快点。

21:03.220 --> 21:05.722
SpongeBob: Don't worry,
I just need to get the key out.
海绵宝宝：别担心，
我只需要把钥匙拿出来。

21:09.351 --> 21:11.937
Give me that,
you incompetent fool.
给我那个，
你这个无能的傻瓜。

21:12.020 --> 21:15.816
Yes, the Krabby Patty
formula is mine.
是的，蟹肉饼
公式是我的。

21:15.899 --> 21:19.444
Uh, I mean, we'll have
a great time.
呃，我是说，我们会有
一段美好的时光。

21:19.528 --> 21:22.280
Now where does Krabs
keep that formula?
现在蟹蟹在哪里
保留那个公式吗？

21:22.364 --> 21:24.074
Whoo, let's rock!
哇，让我们一起摇滚吧！

21:24.157 --> 21:26.743
Yeah.
是的。

21:27.452 --> 21:28.787
All right.
好的。

21:28.870 --> 21:30.414
Squidward, are you ready?
章鱼哥，你准备好了吗？

21:32.374 --> 21:33.667
I'm ready.
我准备好了。

21:33.750 --> 21:35.002
OK.
好的。

21:35.085 --> 21:37.045
Patrick, are you ready
帕特里克，你准备好了吗

21:39.006 --> 21:41.758
Plankton, are you ready?
浮游生物，你准备好了吗？

21:43.468 --> 21:44.803
Plankton?
浮游生物？

21:44.886 --> 21:47.681
Plankton.
浮游生物。

21:47.764 --> 21:50.517
Uh... I'm ready?
呃...我准备好了吗？

21:50.600 --> 21:52.519
SpongeBob: Wait a minute...
海绵宝宝：等一下……

21:52.602 --> 21:56.314
Was this band just a front
so you could steal
the Krabby Patty secret formula?
这支乐队只是一个幌子吗
这样你就可以偷东西
蟹黄派的秘密配方？

21:56.398 --> 22:00.152
What, no, I was in it
for the music, man.
什么，不，我在里面
为了音乐，伙计。

22:05.240 --> 22:08.285
Well, at least
I'm back to my old cell.
嗯，至少
我回到了原来的牢房。

22:08.368 --> 22:09.995
Oh, no, you're not.
哦，不，你不是。

22:10.078 --> 22:12.080
We've got a special
cell for you.
我们有一个特别的
为你准备的细胞。

22:12.164 --> 22:15.042
But I liked my old cell.
但我喜欢我的旧手机。

22:15.125 --> 22:17.544
Then you're gonna love this one.
那你一定会喜欢这个的。

22:17.627 --> 22:20.297
SpongeBob: There's no time
to waste, Plankton.
海绵宝宝：没时间了
浪费，浮游生物。

22:20.380 --> 22:23.467
We've only got 22 years
to practice before our next gig.
我们只有22年
在我们下一场演出之前练习。

22:23.550 --> 22:25.010
A one and a two...
一个一，一个二……

一个一，一个二……